  {t:"listen",say:"Due to the fact that we are in the process of revising our future plans, we will revert back to you at this point in time next week.",q:"¿Por qué este mensaje es un mal ejemplo de estilo?",o:["Tiene errores de ortografía","Es demasiado informal","Está lleno de redundancias y relleno","Usa jerga técnica"],a:2},
  {t:"oral",text:"After decades of pollution, the river was finally cleaned up."}
